{
  "esm": "1.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_cgrid_sum_q",
    "description": "The q-point corner sum on the mom6_cgrid: the sum of the two east-face fields and the two north-face fields around a q-point, sum_q(i,j,k) = (x_u(i,j,k) + x_u(i,j+1,k)) + (x_v(i,j,k) + x_v(i+1,j,k)), where x_u [i,j,k] carries the east-face field (x_u(i,j) the east face of cell (i,j), x_u(i,j+1) the east face of the north neighbor) and x_v [i,j,k] the north-face field (x_v(i,j) the north face of cell (i,j), x_v(i+1,j) the north face of the east neighbor). This is the MOM6 q-cell layer-volume law hArea_q = (hArea_u(i,j) + hArea_u(i,j+1)) + (hArea_v(i,j) + hArea_v(i+1,j)) of MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc :348-357 (the q-point (i,j) sits at the NE corner of cell (i,j)). SOLID-WALL BOUNDARIES: the east domain edge (i = N_I) and the north domain edge (j = N_J) carry a zero-gradient halo, so the wall regions MIRROR the out-of-bounds neighbor onto the edge cell itself: the i = N_I region reads x_v(N_I,j,k) in place of x_v(N_I+1,j,k) and the j = N_J region reads x_u(i,N_J,k) in place of x_u(i,N_J+1,k) (the NE corner mirrors both) — NOT clamped reads of nonexistent cells. The rule is a named-op rule (esm-spec 9.6.8), applied once per consumer equation as mom6_cgrid_sum_q(x_u, x_v); both params must be declared [i,j,k] fields (esm-spec 9.6.1 where clause).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:rule",
      "family:mom6_cgrid",
      "grid:mom6_cgrid",
      "op:sum",
      "order:0",
      "bc:wall",
      "axes:i,j,k"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Adcroft, A., et al. (2019). The GFDL global ocean and sea ice model OM4.0. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 11(10), 3167-3211.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2019MS001726"
      },
      {
        "citation": "MOM6 source: MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc hArea_q :348-357; the q-point convention of the mom6_cgrid grid.esm."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "mom6_cgrid_sum_q": {
      "params": ["x_u", "x_v"],
      "match": {
        "op": "mom6_cgrid_sum_q",
        "args": ["x_u", "x_v"]
      },
      "where": {
        "x_u": {
          "shape": ["i", "j", "k"]
        },
        "x_v": {
          "shape": ["i", "j", "k"]
        }
      },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [
            [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
            [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_J", 1] }],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            ["N_I", "N_I"],
            [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_J", 1] }],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
            ["N_J", "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            ["N_I", "N_I"],
            ["N_J", "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["x_u", "x_v"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
              "j": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_J", 1] }],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "+",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_u", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_u", "i", { "op": "+", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_v", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_v", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["x_u", "x_v"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": ["N_I", "N_I"],
              "j": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_J", 1] }],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "+",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_u", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_u", "i", { "op": "+", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_v", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_v", "i", "j", "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["x_u", "x_v"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
              "j": ["N_J", "N_J"],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "+",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_u", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_u", "i", "j", "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_v", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_v", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["x_u", "x_v"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": ["N_I", "N_I"],
              "j": ["N_J", "N_J"],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "+",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_u", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_u", "i", "j", "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_v", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_v", "i", "j", "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
